WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.034
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:03.470
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.204
And now, if you don't mind,
I'm going to get to the news.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:08.440
The White House announced today
that President Biden's aides

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.243
found classified documents
at several locations

00:00:11.243 --> 00:00:12.979
inside his Delaware home.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.380
And he's had them for a while,

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.352
because a lot of them have to do
with the Louisiana Purchase.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.322
That's right --
The White House announced

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:24.790
that President Biden's aides
found classified documents

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.359
at several
locations at his house,

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:29.595
including in the garage,
next to his vintage Corvette.

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:34.000
And this isn't great --
it's The White House's corvette.

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.770
According to a new book,
then-president Trump

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.506
discussed, in 2017,
the possibility of striking

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.007
North Korea
with a nuclear weapon

00:00:42.007 --> 00:00:44.777
and then blaming it
on another country.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:49.448
Even weirder, he wanted to
blame it on Belgium.

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:51.417
"Why would we do such a thing?"

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.453
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.456 --> 00:01:00.192
That's --
"We don't even have the means!"

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:01.294
That's right -- Trump discussed

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.496
the possibility of
striking North Korea

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:06.132
with a nuclear weapon and then
blaming it on another country.

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:10.570
Oh, my God, seriously?
It's a nuclear war, not a fart.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:16.709
[ As Trump ] It's worked before,
on a smaller scale.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:20.046
I've beta-tested this plan
a few times."

00:01:21.413 --> 00:01:22.982
[ Normal voice ]
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.584
announced yesterday
that he has demoted

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.152
the top military commander
in Ukraine

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.620
and brought in a replacement.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.489
But you know what they say --
every time God closes a door,

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:33.293
Putin opens
a fourth-story window.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:41.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.902
My Pillow C.E.O. Mike Lindell

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.271
said this week
that he has locked in

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.739
enough votes to become chairman

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:48.007
of the
Republican National Committee.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.076
Apparently,
he has the support of over

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:54.180
60% of the voices in his head.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.348
According to a new book,
White House

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:57.283
intelligence officials
were concerned that

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.652
then-president Trump
repeatedly failed to use

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.854
secure phone lines
because North Korea

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:03.556
could be listening
in on his calls.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:07.126
Said Trump, "It's fine.
It's actually who I'm calling."

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.563
Former North Carolina
Congressman Madison Cawthorn

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:12.031
has reportedly moved to Florida.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.133
So he's gone from the
youngest person in Congress

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.769
to the youngest person
in Florida.

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:21.807
The fast-food chain White Castle
has announced

00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:24.009
it will offer Valentine's Day
dinner service,

00:02:24.009 --> 00:02:25.378
which will end in both a

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:28.882
figurative
and literal broken heart.

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:33.686
In her first public appearance
since the release of

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.789
Prince Harry's memoir, "Spare,"
Princess Kate Middleton

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:39.459
was seen driving a car yesterday
outside Windsor Castle.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:44.497
So it looks like we caught Harry
in his first lie.

00:02:46.465 --> 00:02:49.135
A California man
recently got out of his car

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:52.405
to take a phone call
and returned to find the vehicle

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:53.706
had been crushed by a boulder.

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:54.974
I think we have a picture
of the guy?

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:04.117
And, finally,
according to a new study,

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.719
Puerto Rican forest lizards
have gone through

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:10.022
recent genetic changes in order
to survive in urban areas,

00:03:10.022 --> 00:03:13.726
like they know to turn white
when a cop's coming.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.800
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.069
That's the last one.

